{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing the resnet50 image encoder with imagenet_vit_l in a multimodal setup using scvi_n200 RNA encoder, multiprofile settings, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion. The validation accuracy improved to 0.725, suggesting the image encoder choice may contribute to performance. However, the exact role of the image encoder and potential interactions with other components remain uncertain without further isolation of variables."
}

